      ],
      "text": "1.3 Testing for TBI",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        94.91883087158203,
        527.3422241210938,
        109.36183166503906
      ],
      "text": "Testing for TBI increases the certainty that individuals targeted for TPT will benefit better from it. There",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.980582237243652,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        108.11884307861328,
        527.3717041015625,
        122.56184387207031
      ],
      "text": "is, however, no gold standard test for diagnosing TBI. All the currently available tests – TST, IGRA and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        121.31885528564453,
        527.4122314453125,
        135.76185607910156
      ],
      "text": "TBST – are indirect and require a competent immune response for a valid result. A positive test result",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        134.5189971923828,
        527.4277954101562,
        148.9619903564453
      ],
      "text": "by any one method is not by itself a reliable indicator of the risk of progression to TB disease. The",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        147.7189483642578,
        434.2610778808594,
        162.16200256347656
      ],
      "text": "section. evidence and the recommendations for TBI testing are discussed in this",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.41539764404297,
        182.77943420410156,
        513.5936889648438,
        197.22242736816406
      ],
      "text": "17. Either a tuberculin skin test (TST) or interferon-γ release assay (IGRA) can be used to test",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.41439819335938,
        194.7034454345703,
        474.2100830078125,
        210.4224395751953
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, very low certainty of the estimates of effect) for TB infection.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.41439819335938,
        216.4073028564453,
        513.5307006835938,
        232.1262969970703
      ],
      "text": "Mycobacterium tuberculosis 18.   antigen-based skin tests (TBST) may be used to test for TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.41439819335938,
        229.60731506347656,
        465.9009704589844,
        245.32630920410156
      ],
      "text": "(Conditional recommendation, very low certainty of the estimates of effect) infection.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.37223052978516,
        274.8020324707031,
        236.09176635742188,
        293.0720520019531
      ],
      "text": "Justification and evidence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        298.50189208984375,
        527.4256591796875,
        314.2209167480469
      ],
      "text": "(17) Recommendation 17  was originally published in the 2018 WHO guidelines  . A previous systematic",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.951945304870605,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        312.97802734375,
        527.4267578125,
        327.4210510253906
      ],
      "text": "review was updated to compare the predictive performance of IGRA and TST for identifying incident",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        324.9020080566406,
        527.4085693359375,
        340.6210632324219
      ],
      "text": "(67) . Only studies in which TST  TB disease in countries with a TB incidence > 100/100 00 population",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        339.37799072265625,
        527.3811645507812,
        353.8210144042969
      ],
      "text": "was compared with IGRA in the same population were considered, and relative risk ratios for TB for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        352.5780029296875,
        527.3846435546875,
        367.0210266113281
      ],
      "text": "people who tested positive and those who tested negative in those two tests were estimated. (See",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        365.77801513671875,
        283.2728576660156,
        380.2210388183594
      ],
      "text": "the GRADE evidence summaries for PICO 4 in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        283.27679443359375,
        365.77801513671875,
        320.8308410644531,
        380.2210388183594
      ],
      "text": "Annex 3",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        320.8315124511719,
        365.77801513671875,
        326.37548828125,
        380.2210388183594
      ],
      "text": ").",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86607360839844,
        387.4819030761719,
        527.4212646484375,
        401.9249267578125
      ],
      "text": "Five prospective cohort studies were identified, with a total of 7769 participants; four were newly",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86607360839844,
        399.4059143066406,
        527.4238891601562,
        415.12493896484375
      ],
      "text": "(23,68,69,70,71) identified. Three of the studies were conducted in South Africa and two in India  . The",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        413.88189697265625,
        527.1626586914062,
        428.3249206542969
      ],
      "text": "studies included people with HIV, pregnant women, adolescents, health-care workers and household",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.994998931884766,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        427.0819091796875,
        527.4420776367188,
        441.5249328613281
      ],
      "text": "contacts. The pooled risk ratio estimate for TST was 1.49 (95% CI, 0.79 ; 2.80) and that for IGRA was",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        440.28192138671875,
        527.4381713867188,
        454.7249450683594
      ],
      "text": "2.03 (95% CI, 1.18 ; 3.50). Although the estimate for IGRA was slightly higher than that for TST, the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        453.48193359375,
        527.3941650390625,
        467.9249572753906
      ],
      "text": "95% CIs for the estimates for TST and IGRA overlapped and were imprecise. Furthermore, there was",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        466.6819152832031,
        444.0115966796875,
        481.1249694824219
      ],
      "text": "populations. limited evidence for the predictive value of the tests in specific at-risk",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        488.3858947753906,
        527.446533203125,
        502.82891845703125
      ],
      "text": "The GDG concluded that comparison of TST and IGRA in the same population does not provide",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        501.5859375,
        527.3668212890625,
        516.0289306640625
      ],
      "text": "strong evidence that one of the tests should be preferred over the other for predicting progression",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        514.785888671875,
        527.3984985351562,
        529.2288818359375
      ],
      "text": "to TB disease. TST may require significantly fewer resources than IGRA and may be more familiar to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        527.9859619140625,
        527.3925170898438,
        542.428955078125
      ],
      "text": "practitioners in resource-constrained settings; however, recurrent global shortages and stock-outs of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        541.185791015625,
        274.8318786621094,
        555.6287841796875
      ],
      "text": "TST limit prospects for its scale-up in PMTPT.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86604309082031,
        562.8897705078125,
        527.5735473632812,
        577.332763671875
      ],
      "text": "The GDG also noted that equity and access could affect the choice and type of test used. The",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86604309082031,
        576.0897827148438,
        527.6165161132812,
        590.5327758789062
      ],
      "text": "preferences of people to be tested and programmes depend on several factors, such as the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86604309082031,
        589.289794921875,
        527.6137084960938,
        603.7327880859375
      ],
      "text": "requirement for an adequately equipped laboratory (e.g. for IGRA), possible additional costs for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86604309082031,
        602.48974609375,
        527.185791015625,
        616.9327392578125
      ],
      "text": "people being tested (e.g. for travel) and the programme (e.g. for infrastructure and testing). The",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86604309082031,
        615.6897583007812,
        527.4154052734375,
        630.1327514648438
      ],
      "text": "GDG strongly recommended the two tests as equivalent options, with relatively similar advantages",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86604309082031,
        628.8897705078125,
        159.06719970703125,
        643.332763671875
      ],
      "text": "and disadvantages.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86611938476562,
        650.5936889648438,
        527.2500610351562,
        665.0366821289062
      ],
      "text": "The GDG cautioned that imperfect performance of these tests can lead to false-negative results,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86611938476562,
        663.7938232421875,
        527.41455078125,
        678.23681640625
      ],
      "text": "particularly for young children and immunocompromised individuals such as people with HIV with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86611938476562,
        676.99365234375,
        527.4124755859375,
        691.4366455078125
      ],
      "text": "low CD4 counts. The GDG noted the importance of the tests for identifying recent conversion from",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        690.1937255859375,
        527.5429077148438,
        704.63671875
      ],
      "text": "negative to positive, particularly among contacts of people with pulmonary TB, which is good practice",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.97216510772705,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        703.3936767578125,
        527.3804931640625,
        717.836669921875
      ],
      "text": "when initiating TPT. Nevertheless, studies among health-care workers tested serially for TBI in the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        716.5936889648438,
        527.4083251953125,
        731.0366821289062
      ],
      "text": "USA showed that conversion from negative to positive and reversion from positive to negative are",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        728.517822265625,
        527.4268188476562,
        744.23681640625
      ],
      "text": "(72) more commonly identified with IGRA than with TST  . Thus, clinical judgement must still be used",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        742.9937133789062,
        253.470703125,
        757.4367065429688
      ],
      "text": "to interpret the results of serial TBI tests.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        454.0071105957031,
        801.0170288085938,
        554.0402221679688,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "1. Recommendations 19",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
